/**
 * Localisation. Two languages, one flat dictionary, no dependencies.
 *
 * The interface, tutorial, menus and map labels are fully translated. Narrative
 * text generated by the simulation (turn log, resolution lines, node trivia) is
 * written by the engine in English; the UI says so when Persian is active.
 */

